    "",
    "# Rule Matrix",
    "",
    "| Capability Condition | Derived Risk Level | Rationale |",
    "|---|---|---|",
    "| `allow_network == true` \\|\\| `allow_cloud_egress == true` | `ApprovalRisk::High` | Egress/Network allows potential data exfiltration or external side-effects. |",
